    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But isn't that just a Russian talking point? The whole idea that NATO is \"aggressive\" seems pretty one-sided when you consider that these countries are actually choosing to join for their own safety. Can you explain why the Russian view should even be taken as a valid security concern rather than just an excuse for expansionism?",
